OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation after
OL,4,A'suspicious' death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched into the "suspicious death" of
OL,8,Fa man in Plymouth, police have said.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere called by the ambulance service at
OL,12,Fabout 06:40 BST over concerns for the
OL,13,Fwelfare of a man in the West Hoe area.
OL,15,FHe was found seriously injured in a
OL,16,Fservice lane off Grand Parade where he
OL,17,Fwas treated by paramedics, but was
OL,18,Fpronounced dead at the scene, the force
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
