OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation after
OL,4,A'suspicious' death
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives from the major crime
OL,7,Finvestigation team have launched a
OL,8,Fmurder investigation and were carrying
OL,9,Fout inquiries to identify the man and
OL,10,Fthe circumstances surrounding his
OL,11,Fdeath, officers said. Several road
OL,12,Fclosures are in place, including Grand
OL,13,FParade and Garden Crescent.
